# Errors exit with status 2

```console
$ mydiff missing.txt other.txt
? 2
mydiff: error: reading missing.txt: No such file or directory (os error 2)

$ mydiff only-one.txt
? 2
mydiff: error: two inputs are required: mydiff [OPTIONS] <LEFT> <RIGHT> (see --help)

$ mydiff --ignore '(' missing.txt other.txt
? 2
mydiff: error: invalid ignore pattern `(`: regex parse error:
    (
    ^
error: unclosed group: regex parse error:
    (
    ^
error: unclosed group

$ mydiff -w -b a b
? 2
error: the argument '--ignore-all-space' cannot be used with '--ignore-space-change'

Usage: mydiff --ignore-all-space <LEFT> <RIGHT>

For more information, try '--help'.

$ mydiff --mask nonsense a b
? 2
error: invalid value 'nonsense' for '--mask <REGEX=>REPL>': expected 'REGEX=>REPLACEMENT', got 'nonsense'

For more information, try '--help'.

```
